{"1874980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ready for Riot", "steam_appid": 1874980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1874980/extras/212c5ecc4817c167bd694519bb165906.poster.avif?t=1775755383\" width=624 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1874980/extras/212c5ecc4817c167bd694519bb165906.webm?t=1775755383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1874980/extras/212c5ecc4817c167bd694519bb165906.mp4?t=1775755383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>The game is set in American prisons torn by constant prisoner riots. The player controls a police assault group member and recapturing the prison is his objective.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The gameplay revolves around forming a group of 1-4 players helping each other in cooperative missions against computer-controlled prisoners (playing single is available) and then using firearms and different accessories in order to rescue hostages, reclaim prison and/or fulfill any other main/side objectives.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1874980/extras/45f18ff966a50d1a3d622bed0e7d910f.poster.avif?t=1775755383\" width=624 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1874980/extras/45f18ff966a50d1a3d622bed0e7d910f.webm?t=1775755383\" type=\